{%- set faqs = [
  ["Why are security compliance services important for businesses?", "Security compliance services help businesses identify gaps in information security practices and address regulatory obligations. They also support risk management and data protection while improving accountability across security operations."],
  ["Which compliance frameworks does CipherTrivia support?", "CipherTrivia supports security compliance assessments aligned with frameworks such as ISO 27001 and SOC 2 alongside PCI DSS and HIPAA, GDPR, NIST Cybersecurity Framework and CIS Controls. The applicable framework depends on your industry and business requirements."],
  ["What is included in a security compliance assessment?", "A security compliance assessment typically includes a review of security policies and technical controls alongside risk analysis and compliance gap identification. It may also include control mapping and remediation recommendations with supporting documentation for audit preparation."],
  ["How does a security compliance gap assessment work?", "A compliance gap assessment compares your existing security practices against the requirements of a selected framework. The findings identify missing controls and weaknesses alongside recommended corrective actions to help prioritize compliance improvements."],
  ["What is the difference between security compliance and cybersecurity?", "Cybersecurity focuses on protecting systems and data against threats and unauthorized access. Security compliance focuses on meeting applicable regulatory requirements and industry standards through documented policies and appropriate controls, although both areas overlap in practice."],
  ["How long does a security compliance assessment take?", "The timeline depends on the framework and the complexity of your IT environment alongside the number of systems and controls in scope. A focused gap assessment may take a few weeks while larger enterprise assessments can require more time."],
  ["Does CipherTrivia help with ISO 27001 compliance?", "Yes. CipherTrivia can help organizations assess information security controls against ISO 27001 requirements and identify gaps in risk management and security documentation. The assessment findings support improvement planning and preparation for formal certification audits."],
  ["How can SOC 2 compliance services help SaaS companies?", "SOC 2 compliance services help SaaS companies evaluate controls related to security and other applicable Trust Services Criteria. The process can include reviewing access management and monitoring alongside incident response and evidence collection to support audit readiness."],
  ["Do security compliance services include policy documentation?", "Yes. Depending on the agreed scope, services can include reviewing or developing security policies and procedures covering access control and data protection alongside incident management and risk assessment."],
  ["Can security compliance services help prepare for external audits?", "Yes. Compliance services can help identify control gaps and organize supporting documentation while tracking corrective actions before an external audit. Formal audit opinions and certifications must be issued by the appropriate independent auditor or authorized certification body."],
  ["How often should organizations review their security compliance?", "Organizations should review security compliance periodically and after significant changes to systems or business operations. Regular reviews help identify new control gaps and address evolving threats alongside changes in applicable regulatory requirements."]
] %}

