<section class="section section--white" aria-labelledby="s4-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process process--light">
      <div class="process__aside">
        <h2 class="process__title" id="s4-title">Our Security Compliance Assessment Process</h2>
        <p class="process__lede">CipherTrivia follows a structured security compliance assessment process to evaluate existing security controls and identify gaps against applicable regulatory requirements and industry frameworks. Our approach combines risk assessment and control reviews with documentation analysis and remediation planning to help organizations improve compliance readiness.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="process__list" data-process>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Compliance Scope and Requirement Analysis</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We identify applicable compliance frameworks such as ISO 27001, SOC 2, PCI DSS, HIPAA and GDPR based on your industry and business requirements. This helps define the assessment scope and relevant security controls.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Security Gap Assessment</h3>
          <p class="step__text">Our team reviews existing security policies and technical safeguards to identify gaps between current practices and applicable compliance requirements. The assessment covers access controls and data protection alongside infrastructure security and risk management.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Risk Analysis and Control Evaluation</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We evaluate identified gaps based on their severity and potential business impact while reviewing the effectiveness of relevant security controls. This helps prioritize compliance risks and determine the corrective actions required.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Remediation Planning</h3>
          <p class="step__text">CipherTrivia provides actionable recommendations to address identified compliance gaps and improve security practices. We outline corrective measures and practical priorities to help your team plan remediation based on available resources and compliance objectives.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Documentation and Compliance Reporting</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We prepare assessment findings and document identified gaps alongside recommended improvements and relevant control evidence. These deliverables help organizations track remediation progress and prepare for internal reviews or external compliance audits.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

